cant threat. A small bet here (around 500-700) serves as both a value bet against weaker hands and protection against draws. If they have an Ace, they'll likely call, but if they're on a draw or have a weak pair, they might fold. Given I'm already ahead in the match, I should apply pressure but not risk too much. A continuation bet of 600 chips is reasonable - it's enough to charge draws but not so large that I'm committed if raised.\n\n**Answer:** 600"}
